      (date "2025-06-15T01:45:04")
      (text "The National Union of Journalists (NUJ) homepage provides information about its mission, activities, and support for journalists. It highlights key initiatives, including workplace representation, ethical journalism, and advocacy for press freedom. The site also features updates on industry news, campaigns, and resources for members."))
