      (text "Subject: Making a Difference—One Donation at a Time\n\nDear [Member's Name],\n\nWe know the power of journalism—it shapes conversations, holds truth to account, and keeps us all informed. But behind every byline, there are real people—people who sometimes need a helping hand. That’s where NUJ Extra comes in, offering vital support to journalists facing hardship.\n\nIf you've ever wondered how you can help, there are plenty of ways to pitch in. A one-off donation is always appreciated—it’s like buying a colleague a coffee, but one that goes a lot further! If you’ve recently opted out of subscriptions, why not consider a regular donation instead? Even a small monthly amount ensures ongoing support where it’s needed most.\n\nFor those thinking long-term, a bequest—including NUJ Extra in your will—is an incredible way to leave a lasting impact. We also accept contributions from literary estates, ensuring that a journalist's legacy continues to support their peers. Plus, we’ve got other fun...")
