      (date "2025-06-05T17:24:12")
      (text "84 This DM notes with alarm the increasing tendency of An Garda Siochana and the PSNI to view journalists, and in particular photographers and videographers, as alternate sources of evidence gathering for police forces, particularly in instances of civil unrest, riots and other protests that break the law.  DM also notes that, as well as approaching individual journalists and media organisations, to ask them to voluntarily hand over unpublished visual material; these police forces are increasingly resorting to production orders and warrants, in attempts to acquire this material.  As well as negatively impacting upon the public’s perception of all journalists as independent news gatherers, the actions of these police forces also have a chilling effect on media coverage of such public events, because media companies and freelances might avoid covering them in future. It also increases aggression towards journalists covering these incidents, with a noticeable increase in threats to media ...")
      (truncated #t))
